                <mxCell id="1-20" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#64748B;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="NodePort 30083 to container port 8080; host port 8083 reaches it through k3d. Inside the cluster it is &lt;b&gt;python.wcf-physics.svc:8080&lt;/b&gt;, the name Istio discovers and routes on. Planned: name the port &lt;i&gt;http&lt;/i&gt;." vertex="1">
