                <mxCell id="4-1" value="4 · Traffic management: a mesh retry is a resend unless the request carries a key" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1E3A8A;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
